      },
      "original": {
        "text": "We're going to study the book of Revelation. This book has fascinated people for centuries. For some people, it's scary, like the sci-fi section of the Bible. For others, it's confusing. But really, it shouldn't be either one of those.",
        "sha256": "26688c073a93e551e05a19169d236d53ed1e9bddeb140249c8ac228bf418c807",
        "transcriptStatus": "machine_screening_only",
        "referenceAudioSha256": "26688c073a93e551e05a19169d236d53ed1e9bddeb140249c8ac228bf418c807"
      },
      "samples": [
        {
          "locale": "zh-Hans",
          "modelLanguage": "Chinese",
          "text": "我们将研读《启示录》。几个世纪以来，这卷书一直让人着迷。有些人觉得它很可怕，像是圣经中的科幻篇；另一些人觉得它难以理解。但其实，它不该让人害怕，也不该令人困惑。",
          "textSha256": "3edb454bd857fde54c55e33e51e082d32e23abce4c1d2aa8651f429549ad9e2b",
          "sourceEnglishTextSha256": "106cfbb3a7a6863e1c76a7577f66f760eb6fb2f35fbb4d10cd345f2be98f78b9",
          "translationReviewStatus": "machine_candidate_human_review_pending"
        },
        {
          "locale": "ko",
          "modelLanguage": "Korean",
          "text": "우리는 요한계시록을 공부하려고 합니다. 이 책은 수세기 동안 사람들의 관심을 끌어 왔습니다. 어떤 사람들에게는 성경의 공상과학 부분처럼 무섭게 느껴집니다. 또 다른 사람들에게는 혼란스럽습니다. 하지만 사실 이 책은 어느 쪽으로도 느껴져서는 안 됩니다.",
          "textSha256": "cbae98eb96e7b2868a874e23476d4cee1149987999613049d57e3ab5e081a32b",
          "sourceEnglishTextSha256": "106cfbb3a7a6863e1c76a7577f66f760eb6fb2f35fbb4d10cd345f2be98f78b9",
          "translationReviewStatus": "machine_candidate_human_review_pending"
        },
        {
          "locale": "es",
          "modelLanguage": "Spanish",
          "text": "Vamos a estudiar el libro de Apocalipsis. Este libro ha fascinado a la gente durante siglos. Para algunos, da miedo, como si fuera la sección de ciencia ficción de la Biblia. Para otros, resulta confuso. Pero, en realidad, no debería ser ninguna de las dos cosas.",
          "textSha256": "8172dc1c9ccbaf6640735f16428fd35b1330526fd152bd1e5bb1b03a27a51162",
          "sourceEnglishTextSha256": "106cfbb3a7a6863e1c76a7577f66f760eb6fb2f35fbb4d10cd345f2be98f78b9",
          "translationReviewStatus": "machine_candidate_human_review_pending"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speakerId": "jared_kirkwood",
      "clipId": "jared_kirkwood-source-clip-v2",
      "displayName": "Jared Kirkwood",
      "source": {
        "id": "M20vokXIblw",
